----------------------------------------------------------------
Note on the synthesis source
----------------------------------------------------------------
This soundfont was sound-designed by the author using DEXED, an
open-source DX7 FM synthesizer (GPL v3). The sound is an original
FM patch inspired by the Yamaha MODX m7 "Wr typedeck" preset and
classic DX7 electric piano tones; it is not a copy of any Yamaha
factory ROM data, and contains no samples from any commercial
sample library.

The GPL license of DEXED applies to DEXED's source code, not to
the audio you create with it, so this soundfont is not required to
be GPL.
